## Summary

**New module `src/git.rs`** (subprocess-only, read-only, no new deps):
- `GitError::{NotInRepo, Git{args,code,stderr}, Spawn, Io}`, `GitOutput{code,stdout,stderr}`, `EnvPolicy::{Inherit, StripHookContext}`
- `run()` — canonical runner; `repo_root()/repo_root_from()` — walk-based, `.git`-file-aware, GIT_DIR-independent
- `changed_files`, `changed_files_between`, `uncommitted_files`, `uncommitted_files_lossy` (documented empty-on-failure), unborn-HEAD → untracked fallback
